    "保存 Luma 内的高亮、文字笔记、书签及阅读进度。请让各设备连接同一同步目录，并等待云盘客户端完成上传和下载。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync Luma highlights, notes, bookmarks and progress. Connect each device to the same folder and let your cloud client finish uploading and downloading."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存 Luma 内的高亮、文字笔记、书签及阅读进度。请让各设备连接同一同步目录，并等待云盘客户端完成上传和下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
