    "其他阅读器的私有批注不会自动导入。这里的成功状态表示已写入同步目录，不代表云端传输已经完成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Private annotations from other readers are not imported automatically. Success means the sync folder was written, not that cloud transfer has finished."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他阅读器的私有批注不会自动导入。这里的成功状态表示已写入同步目录，不代表云端传输已经完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
