    "每家单独保存密钥与模型。切换会将本次对话历史发送给所选服务；关闭“附带当前阅读”可排除书籍上下文。仅发送时调用 API，对话不写入云存档。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keys and models are saved per provider. Switching sends this conversation to the selected provider. Disable reading context to exclude book excerpts. API requests happen only when sending; conversations are not included in cloud archives."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
