        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KSCrash is the sole handler. Raw reports may contain system paths; memory introspection is disabled. Raw reports are never exported. Restart to disable an installed handler. The CPU toggle does not control KSCrash resource tracking."
